name: sim.setBoolProperty
description: Sets a boolean property
luaSynopsis: sim.setBoolProperty(int target, string propertyName, bool propertyState, dict options = {})
pythonSynopsis: sim.setBoolProperty(int target, string propertyName, bool propertyState, map options = {})
inputs:
1. target: target item
2. propertyName: property name
3. propertyState: property value
4. options: an optional map. Set options.noError to true for silent errors
outputs:
